<!-- Items-and-Crafting.md, "Crafted items": a section after Stormbreaker -->
### The Ultron Program

```
I E I
R S R
I E I

I = Block of Iron
E = Echo Shard
R = Block of Redstone
S = Nether Star
```

Stark's peacekeeping program, waiting for a mind: a dark steel data core with a red scanline that runs down it. It does nothing alone. Hold it in one hand and use Loki's Scepter on open, level ground with Sneak and Ultron wakes: see [Ultron](Ultron). It is used up only when the ritual starts, and is given back if the fight is stopped, the server stops or the world goes Peaceful. Fireproof, does not stack. To make one you need a Wither, an Ancient City and thirty-six iron.

<!-- Items-and-Crafting.md: a new section "Rewards of the bosses" (shared with the other bosses' rewards), after "Items found in the world" -->
### Ultron's Core

The heart Wanda tore out, in a cage of three gunmetal bars: a glowing red-orange sphere that pulses. It is the reward of the Ultron fight: every fighter who was there for a minute and hurt him gets one, and so does whoever lands the last blow; it is never crafted and never found in a chest. On its own it does nothing. A player with no power who holds it in one hand and uses Loki's Scepter with the other becomes [Ultron](Ultron) (the Core is used up). Fireproof, does not stack.
